#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:5
#: 9d987785d8c241228d3d55b389fa37a5
msgid "NVidia TX2 as a Companion Computer"
msgstr "NVidia TX2 作为伴飞计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:7
#: 8033bb7d6fa64b3fb5950ba197cdbc5f
msgid ""
"This page explains how to connect and configure an `NVidia TX2 "
"<https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/autonomous-machines/embedded-systems-dev-kits-"
"modules/>`__ using `AuVidea.eu's J120 carrier board "
"<http://auvidea.com/j120/>`__ so that it is able to communicate with a "
"Pixhawk flight controller using the MAVLink protocol over a serial "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何使用 `AuVidea.eu 的 J120 载板 <http://auvidea.com/j120/>`__ 连接和配置 `NVidia "
"TX2 <https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/autonomous-machines/embedded-systems-dev-"
"kits-modules/>`__，使其能够通过串行连接上的 MAVLink 协议与 Pixhawk 飞控进行通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:10
#: 76b4904684264c439c5611f01096fbb7
msgid "Connecting the Pixhawk and TX2"
msgstr "连接 Pixhawk 和 TX2"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:14
#: 9954d98eafe04dc6b43e4c485c4d0338
msgid ""
"Connect the Pixhawk's TELEM2 port to the J120's UART2 port's Ground, TX and "
"RX pins as shown in the image above."
msgstr "如上图所示，将 Pixhawk 的 TELEM2 端口连接到 J120 的 UART2 端口的 GND、TX 和 RX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:16
#: 04060a4b4a204474baced1e8107867c2
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk and TX2 should be powered separately (the J120/TX2 through it's "
"12V power input port, the Pixhawk through it's POWER port)."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 和 TX2 应分别独立供电（J120/TX2 通过其 12V 电源输入口供电，Pixhawk 通过其 POWER 口供电）。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:19
#: 02ef60514a734ac8949e71f501b150de
msgid "Setup the Pixhawk"
msgstr "设置 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:21
#: 2304cfd1b4c94e45841e0464642c6483
msgid ""
"Connect to the Pixhawk with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and set "
"the following parameters:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接 Pixhawk 并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:23
#: 1046b50f1fc84a87af5fbb8490b4272d
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (the default) to "
"enable MAVLink on the serial port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1（默认值），以在串口上启用 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:24
#: 2329c98da6224990aa1673aabac48f39
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 1500 so the Pixhawk can "
"communicate with the TX2 at 1,500,000 baud."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 1500，使 Pixhawk 能以 1,500,000 波特率与"
" TX2 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:25
#: 7d0081878bff4ac4b3852a45ca2cb327
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3 if you are using "
"APSync to stream the dataflash log files to the TX2"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3，如果使用 APSync 将 "
"dataflash 日志文件流传输到 TX2"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:27
#: a0f196eb0c4c4a00aa44a698f26a3d9b
msgid ""
"You may need to manually disable flow control on Telem2 although this is not"
" normally required:"
msgstr "通常情况下不需要，但您可能需要手动禁用 Telem2 上的流控制："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:29
#: 1fca0fd267bd472b9db2e3298fa0fe72
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <copter:BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <copter:BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:31
#: 0bb2e88a1a0d45a394c8a51c5229a7c3
msgid "As a side note the J120's UART2 appears on the TX2 as /dev/ttyTHS1."
msgstr "补充说明：J120 的 UART2 在 TX2 上显示为 /dev/ttyTHS1。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:34
#: 258bb1fdf58246ac993c6f7fa67e7752
msgid "Setup the TX2"
msgstr "设置 TX2"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:36
#: c33905ddc47b4e5bbfa43b56c7dd3ebc
msgid "There are two steps required to setting up the TX2:"
msgstr "设置 TX2 需要两个步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:38
#: 65ad9f078a614bc6a8be63e5d990950a
msgid ""
"install JetPack-3.3 to an Ubuntu 16 desktop and flash the TX2 operating "
"system"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 16 桌面上安装 JetPack-3.3 并烧录 TX2 操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:39
#: e9b09ab077684ae0add9f3e985e9bfc5
msgid "flash the APSync image to the TX2"
msgstr "将 APSync 镜像烧录到 TX2"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:42
#: c15de52976284e1994412991e148d84f
msgid "Installing JetPack-3.3 and flashing the OS"
msgstr "安装 JetPack-3.3 并烧录操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:44
#: c0134871ce104a058fc380853df9780e
msgid "First put the TX2 into bootloader mode"
msgstr "首先将 TX2 置于引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:46
#: a8ef2d2873f34a679e8d2cd0338e62dc
msgid "connect the TX2 to an Ubuntu 16.04 machine using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线将 TX2 连接到 Ubuntu 16.04 机器"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:47
#: 7d84a1575ba04974ab8a329e522048d6
msgid ""
"put the TX2 into bootloader mode by holding the \"Force Recovery\" button "
"(aka \"REC\"), then press the \"Reset\" button (aka \"RST\") and then "
"release the \"Force Recovery\" button"
msgstr ""
"按住「Force Recovery」按钮（即「REC」），然后按「Reset」按钮（即「RST」），再松开「Force Recovery」按钮，使 "
"TX2 进入引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:48
#: 2176046ac98e4b20b93bd697b51ad0d4
msgid ""
"check the TX2 is in bootloader mode by typing \"lsusb\" on the Ubuntu "
"machine and look for \"NVidia Corp\""
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上输入「lsusb」，查找「NVidia Corp」，确认 TX2 已进入引导加载程序模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:52
#: 3cc3ec44eed2426eaad4f58bc42ca6ad
msgid "Next install JetPack and flash the OS"
msgstr "接下来安装 JetPack 并烧录操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:54
#: fba75ac0b6d14ad7a123172f245cd1f8
msgid ""
"connect an Ubuntu 16.04 machine to the internet and download `JetPack-3.3 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/dlc/jetpack-l4t-3_3>`__ (nvidia login"
" required) from the `Jetson Download Center "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/downloads>`__."
msgstr ""
"将 Ubuntu 16.04 机器连接到互联网，从 `Jetson 下载中心 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/downloads>`__ 下载 `JetPack-3.3 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/embedded/dlc/jetpack-l4t-3_3>`__（需要 nvidia "
"账号登录）。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:55
#: 8992ce91e46643da830cab9e13ee34ec
msgid ""
"move the downloaded file to the directory you want JetPack installed into "
"(i.e. \"~/Desktop/JetPack-3.3\")"
msgstr "将下载的文件移动到您希望安装 JetPack 的目录（如「~/Desktop/JetPack-3.3」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:56
#: 9a44d62cc92742b2bc0931e4c4b47c9b
msgid ""
"make sure the file is executable by typing, \"chmod a+x "
"JetPack-L4T-3.3-linux-x64_b39.run\""
msgstr "输入「chmod a+x JetPack-L4T-3.3-linux-x64_b39.run」确保文件可执行"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:57
#: 30fe9ee8094f4768808a18379742525f
msgid ""
"start the installation by running the downloaded file, "
"\"./JetPack-L4T-3.3-linux-x64_b39.run\""
msgstr "运行下载的文件「./JetPack-L4T-3.3-linux-x64_b39.run」开始安装"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:58
#: 996797de9a2e4eacab7de4efadb601b2
msgid "a \"JetPack L4T 3.3 Installer\" window should appear, press \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「JetPack L4T 3.3 Installer」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:59
#: 254b4b6a43f54a43bde76ee9e7465ad9
msgid ""
"a \"Installation Configuration\" page should appear confirming where JetPack"
" will be installed, press \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「Installation Configuration」页面，确认 JetPack 的安装位置，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:60
#: 089d38ba59eb42ee8328016ec7ea3003
msgid ""
"a \"Select Development Environment\" page should appear allowing you to "
"select the board type, select \"Jetson TX2\""
msgstr "应出现「Select Development Environment」页面，选择板卡类型，选择「Jetson TX2」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:64
#: cea8bfb0e3fd40efbfacfe28db0811bb
msgid ""
"an \"Installing\" page will appear asking for your password in order to "
"begin the local installation"
msgstr "将出现「Installing」页面，要求输入密码以开始本地安装"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:65
#: bf451b9dbfbf4261aecee9a8adbe2ff0
msgid "a \"JetPack L4T Component Manager\" screen should appear"
msgstr "应出现「JetPack L4T Component Manager」界面"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:67
#: d3a8da45840f42a386d43e9a5aa530c0
msgid ""
"from the top left, select \"JetPack L4T 3.3\" (this may need to be selected "
"two or three times to work)"
msgstr "从左上角选择「JetPack L4T 3.3」（可能需要选择两到三次才能生效）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:68
#: 0ec3083a3f80493ea49b0322dc280b0a
msgid ""
"for \"Host - Ubuntu\" set the \"Action\" column to \"no action\" for "
"everything (select \"Keep & Apply\" if a question pops up)"
msgstr ""
"对于「Host - Ubuntu」，将所有项目的「Action」列设为「no action」（若弹出询问，选择「Keep & Apply」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:69
#: a03d9db98e9642258b320610f0775b44
msgid "Target - Jetson TX2: mixed"
msgstr "Target - Jetson TX2：mixed"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:70
#: 165ae62dcc4e48cdb9e70fa8e23b22d1
msgid "Linux for Tegra Host Side Image Setup: install"
msgstr "Linux for Tegra Host Side Image Setup：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:71
#: c6cf0e3bd37746ce9801ee854365c85c
msgid "Flash OS Image to Target: install 24.2.1"
msgstr "Flash OS Image to Target：install 24.2.1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:72
#: c873bd515f80483dad6cd280f703f31e
msgid "Install on Target: mixed"
msgstr "Install on Target：mixed"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:73
#: 49c118f1961c43dd86571ada642b9f8b
msgid "CUDA Toolkit: install"
msgstr "CUDA Toolkit：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:74
#: 42b855bf74ed43488315f6937d3b29db
msgid "Compile CUDA Samples: no action"
msgstr "Compile CUDA Samples：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:75
#: f631f0f03548491fbdcac623a8387c2b
msgid "PerfKit: install"
msgstr "PerfKit：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:76
#: f2e16892edc54d6cb3ac586313d4e98c
msgid "TensorRT: install"
msgstr "TensorRT：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:77
#: 1a709420b5d84118a5ca8bf0f2108e67
msgid "Multimedia API package: no action"
msgstr "Multimedia API package：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:78
#: 34258da8baa54a93ab9fc7f42a0f10f4
msgid "cuDNN Package: install"
msgstr "cuDNN Package：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:79
#: d8467d9ef3804a739453c6bedba2c84f
msgid "OpenCV for Tegra: install"
msgstr "OpenCV for Tegra：install"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:80
#: 85a727c899e342ee9fcc49783df95776
msgid "VisionWorks on TX2 Target: no action"
msgstr "VisionWorks on TX2 Target：no action"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:84
#: 5c1d349d79f34c6e8ccd27f74e8db2e8
msgid ""
"an \"Terms & Conditions\" window may appear, select \"Accept All\" and push "
"the \"Accept\" button"
msgstr "可能出现「Terms & Conditions」窗口，选择「Accept All」并点击「Accept」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:85
#: c3a3af5f40b246a08f4a34d6dfde1067
msgid ""
"a \"Host installation is complete\" window should appear, check below before"
" pushing \"Next\""
msgstr "应出现「Host installation is complete」窗口，点击「Next」前请参阅以下说明"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:87
#: a5f4146d22bb4ed498c0568956a82fe0
msgid ""
"At this point, users of AUVidea carrier boards (like the J120) should follow"
" `these instructions <https://auvidea.com/firmware/>`__ to download and "
"patch the kernel to allow the USB ports to work:"
msgstr ""
"此时，AUVidea 载板（如 J120）用户应按照 `这些说明 <https://auvidea.com/firmware/>`__ "
"下载并修补内核以使 USB 端口正常工作："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:98
#: 26e9dfda76474437b9cd5cd6294c2f37
msgid "back on the \"Host installation is complete\" window, press \"Next\""
msgstr "返回「Host installation is complete」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:99
#: 69cd420af2184c50a7e83e6f612458ee
msgid ""
"a \"Network Layout - Jetson TX2\" window should appear, select \"Device "
"accesses Internet via router/switch\" after first ensuring the TX2 and "
"Ubuntu machine are connected to the internet with an ethernet cable"
msgstr ""
"应出现「Network Layout - Jetson TX2」窗口，首先确保 TX2 和 Ubuntu "
"机器已通过以太网线连接到互联网，然后选择「Device accesses Internet via router/switch」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:100
#: 09f1489b96464cc3b933abf06bc7b1f8
msgid ""
"if a \"Network Interface Selection\" window pops up, select the Ubuntu "
"machine's network connection that corresponds to the ethernet cable"
msgstr "若弹出「Network Interface Selection」窗口，选择 Ubuntu 机器上对应以太网线的网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:104
#: 02b14b349db542a9bced324f4fe1ebc6
msgid "a \"Post Installation Jetson TX2\" window may appear, press \"Next\""
msgstr "可能出现「Post Installation Jetson TX2」窗口，点击「Next」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:105
#: 5f05518484a8458c83c4419a28b35eff
msgid ""
"a black console window titled, \"Post Installation\" should appear asking "
"that the TX2 be put in bootloader mode (this should already have been done),"
" Press \"Enter\""
msgstr ""
"应出现标题为「Post Installation」的黑色控制台窗口，要求将 TX2 置于引导加载程序模式（应已完成此操作），按「Enter」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:106
#: 12233224f02146409fffe714a617034e
msgid ""
"installation should continue for about 15min and finally a message should "
"appear asking you to close the black console window."
msgstr "安装将继续约 15 分钟，最终出现提示要求关闭黑色控制台窗口的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:107
#: 1755206540d04ee2be3d06535fee3814
msgid ""
"an \"Installation Complete\" window should appear, leave \"Remove downloaded"
" files\" unchecked and press \"Finish\""
msgstr "应出现「Installation Complete」窗口，不勾选「Remove downloaded files」并点击「Finish」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:110
#: 64bd123680fd4ec8a4f01a6de6f00b7a
msgid "Flashing the APSync image to the TX2"
msgstr "将 APSync 镜像烧录到 TX2"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:112
#: 8cae495fcf2941319a001b2b5963600f
msgid ""
"connect a USB cable from the Ubuntu 16 machine to the TX2 development board,"
" power on the TX2 and put the TX2 into bootloader mode (see instructions "
"above)"
msgstr "将 USB 线从 Ubuntu 16 机器连接到 TX2 开发板，给 TX2 上电并将其置于引导加载程序模式（参见上述说明）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:113
#: 1292a903e7a3485a867218e5c3f524d1
msgid ""
"On the Ubuntu 16 machine, download the latest APSync image for the TX2 from "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta>`__ (look for images "
"that contain \"tx2\" like \"apsync-tx2-201804270923.img.xy\")."
msgstr ""
"在 Ubuntu 16 机器上，从 `firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/beta>`__ 下载最新的适用于 TX2 的 "
"APSync 镜像（查找包含「tx2」的镜像，如「apsync-tx2-201804270923.img.xy」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:114
#: ad1edee0f2cf44438071310180a7a9d5
msgid ""
"uncompress the downloaded image (i.e. open a file explorer, right-mouse-"
"button click on the file and select \"Extract Here\")"
msgstr "解压下载的镜像（即打开文件管理器，右键单击文件并选择「在此处解压」）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:115
#: 1d860ea709184e7085315cab013df6ad
msgid ""
"on the Ubuntu machine, from the directory where you installed JetPack (i.e. "
"~/Desktop/JetPack-3.3)"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上，切换到您安装 JetPack 的目录（如 ~/Desktop/JetPack-3.3）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:116
#: 3ba42d2267684286b3edb96d8675eaca
msgid "cd 64_TX2/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx2/bootloader"
msgstr "cd 64_TX2/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx2/bootloader"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:117
#: ad1b526b97c74595a42f3776f62eeabc
msgid ""
"copy and rename the apsync image downloaded above to "
"\"64_TX2/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx2/bootloader/system.img\""
msgstr ""
"将上述下载的 APSync 镜像复制并重命名为「64_TX2/Linux_for_Tegra_64_tx2/bootloader/system.img」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:118
#: 22ea5a6b6abe49dab737342a552fff81
msgid ""
"run this command to upload the image, sudo ./flash.sh -r -k APP jetson-tx2 "
"mmcblk0p1"
msgstr "运行以下命令上传镜像：sudo ./flash.sh -r -k APP jetson-tx2 mmcblk0p1"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:122
#: 31c6fa854edc4f609731b9ea5772e82b
msgid ""
"Some instructions on flashing images can be found `here "
"<https://elinux.org/Jetson/TX2_Cloning>`__."
msgstr "一些烧录镜像的说明可在 `此处 <https://elinux.org/Jetson/TX2_Cloning>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:125
#: 0080f08937e14539a8730b1318f8f3d3
msgid "Notes if using ZED camera or RPLidarA2"
msgstr "使用 ZED 摄像头或 RPLidarA2 的注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-nvidia-tx2.rst:127
#: 49d56d448c4c4729bd2e2554a6266d30
msgid ""
"If you are using the `StereoLabs <https://www.stereolabs.com/>`__ :ref:`ZED "
"camera <copter:common-zed>` then the TX2 will need to be powered up once "
"with the ethernet cable plugged in so that it has access to the internet in "
"order to download the camera's factory calibration."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `StereoLabs <https://www.stereolabs.com/>`__ :ref:`ZED 摄像头 "
